The Forge anvil, used here only to identify the Forge mod loader; Forge and
its logo are trademarks of Forge Development LLC. Derived from
https://github.com/MinecraftForge/MinecraftForge/blob/26.3/docs/assets/Forge_logo.svg
(LGPL 2.1, per that repository's LICENSE.txt): the anvil path alone, unchanged,
in a square viewBox, filled with the tan #DFA86A that the same file uses for
its wordmark instead of its navy #1E2D41, so it reads on dark backgrounds too.
